# Model overrides. Every one of these has a working default in app/config.py — set a line here only
# to override it. Model swap is an env change; provider swap is providers.py (ADR-001, ADR-002).
# TEXT_MODEL=qwen/qwen3-32b
# VLM_JUDGE_MODEL=google/gemma-3-27b-it
# FAL_IMAGE_MODEL=fal-ai/qwen-image

# Reverted to the config.py default 2026-07-29, after Phase-0.5 Run 3. Qwen composes scenes better;
# OmniGen2 (rung 1) holds identity better and is kept as the escalation, not as the default.
# NOT a free-text swap: an endpoint missing from providers.REFERENCE_FIELD raises, because fal drops
# unknown argument names silently and would otherwise degrade every reference-conditioned call to
# plain text-to-image. Uncomment to put rung 1 back:
# FAL_IMAGE_EDIT_MODEL=fal-ai/omnigen-v2
